> The steps you want to take are:
>
> 1. convert from vcf to genlight
> 2. convert from genlight to snpclone (https://knausb.github.io/vcfR_documentation/export_genlight_snpclone.html#creating-snpclone-objects)
> 3. confirm that the ploidy, populations, strata, and loci are correct
> 4. filter
>
